kke til person endepunkt parametere | access package delegation to actor person accessmanagement", :timestamp "2026-06-11T08:10:46.075388Z", :total-tokens 14965, :run-id "83438026-8fd8-4937-b284-95c5c1fe4ca2", :golden-display-rank nil, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 0.0} {:response "For å delegere en tilgangspakke via Access Management-api-et bruker du følgende endepunkt og spørreparametere [1]:\n\n**Endepunkter:**\n- Test: `POST https://platform.tt02.altinn.no/accessmanagement/api/v1/enduser/connections/accesspackages`\n- Produksjon: `POST https://platform.altinn.no/accessmanagement/api/v1/enduser/connections/accesspackages`\n\n**Spørreparametere:**\n| Parameter | Type | Obligatorisk | Beskrivelse |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `party` | UUID | Ja | partyUuid for parten |\n| `to` | UUID | Nei | partyUuid for mottaker (alternativ til body) |\n| `packageId` | UUID | Nei | ID for tilgangspakken |\n| `package` | string | Nei | URN for tilgangspakken |\n\nMerk at kilden også viser et eksempel på en forespørselskropp (`body`) med felt som `personIdentifier`, men de spesifikke parametrene du skal bruke i endepunktets spørring er oppført over [1]. Du spesifiserer pakken ved å sende enten `packageId` eller `package`.", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-authz-01-delegere-tilgangspakke-api", :empty? false, :llm-calls 2, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 518, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "snippet-AB+matchq", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-authorization,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "dd42c77ed5fe8 R21.8 P4.8 h4.0 or1.6 L6997 10/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+metadata+phrase b[0.1,0.0,0.0,0.5,0.1,0.0] +q | Access management", :response-chars 923, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 3, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 4, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode