ry endpoint from the Storage API in the Platform for that purpose [1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-api-04-instances-get-no-list", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 500, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "snippet-AB+matchq", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-3-general,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d69ccc279de8b R26.2 P3.7 h3.0 or1.5 L1444 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Instances", :response-chars 739, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 2, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "b1040a899047;9bce844fa9ba", :enrichment-hits 50, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 7743, :pool-head "df37862b10fdc R26.3 P2.6 h2.0 or1.7 L1400 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Instances", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "9bce844fa9ba", :expected-chunk-ids "9bce844fa9ba", :elapsed-ms 242458, :issued-queries "app instance metadata api | list all app instances | instance details single", :timestamp "2026-06-11T08:34:01.490070Z", :total-tokens 8243, :run-id "5b711b8e-6f41-4699-9713-31d2d3ba6360", :golden-display-rank 2, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "To fetch the metadata for a single app instance, you can use this endpoint:\n```http\nGET {basePath}/{instanceOwnerPartyId}/{instanceGuid}\n```\nThis call downloads the instance metadata document and is intended for active instances where both the owner party id and instance guid are already known `[1][2]`. The base path format follows `{org}/{appname}/instances` `[1][2]`.\n\nAs for listing all instances, there is no such endpoint in the App API. The documentation explicitly states that \"The app API does not have an endpoint for listing instances\" `[1][2]`. Instead, you must use a query endpoint available in the Storage API on the Platform to retrieve instance lists or data across multiple sessions `[1][2]`.", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-api-04-instances-get-no-list", :empty? false, :llm-calls 2, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 414, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "snippet-AB+matchq", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-3-general,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d69ccc279de8b R25.0 P3.7 h3.0 or1.7 L1444 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Instances", :response-chars 711, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 2, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "b1040a899047;9bce844fa9ba", :enrichment-hits 46, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 6306, :pool-head "df37862b10fdc R25.5 P3.7 h3.0 or1.9 L1400 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Instances", :repeat 2, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "b1040a899047;9bce844fa9ba", :expected-chunk-ids "9bce844fa9ba", :elapsed-ms 244485, :issued-queries "get instance metadata endpoint | list all instances endpoint org_app_instances | fetch single app instance details", :timestamp "2026-06-11T08:38:05.976732Z", :total-tokens 6720, :run-id "c430c2bf-3e1f-4e92-8abe-2f2fd44bfb2a", :golden-display-rank 2, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "To fetch the metadata for a single app instance, use the following GET request with the App API:\n```http\nGET {basePath}/{instanceOwnerPartyId}/{instanceGuid}\n```[1]. This endpoint downloads the instance's metadata document and is intended for active instances where you already know both the `instanceOwnerPartyId` and the `instanceGuid`, alongside a `{basePath}` formatted as `{org}/{appname}/instances`[1].\n\nRegarding listing all instances: The App API **does not have an endpoint** to list or query multiple instances[1]. Instead, you must use the **Storage API in the Platform**, which provides a separate query endpoint at `https://{hostname}/storage/api/v1/instances` (referenced as `{storagePath}/instances`) for this purpose[2]. This Storage API allows you to fetch instance lists by applying filters via query parameters such as `appId`, `org`, or `instanceOwner.partyId`, and supports pagination using the `size` parameter alongside a `continuationToken` in the response[2].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-api-04-instances-get-no-list", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 517, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "snippet-AB", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-3-general,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d69ccc279de8b R24.9 P3.7 h3.0 or2.0 L1444 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Instances", :response-chars 984, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 2, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "9bce844fa9ba;6c35ac48bb9c", :enrichment-hits 70, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 7759, :pool-head "df37862b10fdc R25.4 P3.6 h3.0 or1.3 L1400 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Instances", :repeat 2, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "9bce844fa9ba;6c35ac