led requests» [2] der du kan forespørre hendelsesdataene manuell eller på faste intervaller. Denne muligheten ble implementert hovedsakelig for å sikre smidige og gradvise arkitektoniske migreringer uten å tvinge alle til et umiddelbart bytte av integrasjonsmønster [1].\n\nDet bør likevel understrekes at den offisielt anbefalte fremgangsmåten fortsatt er abonnement via webhooks, der mottakeren registrerer en egen endpoint og mottar data asynkront [3]. Ved uresponsiv webhook tilbyr systemet dessuten et innebygd retry-mekanisme med opptil 12 forsøk [3].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-events-03-polling-vs-webhook", :empty? false, :llm-calls 4, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 584, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 0.0, :config-id "enriched-hq", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-events,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "dae894f1e7b46 R21.5 P2.5 h2.0 or1.1 L679 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Query events", :response-chars 750, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 3, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 17, :golden-read? false, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "0982030b4be9;d7270862768a;fb897d22bdf4", :enrichment-hits 22, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 0.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 3, :prompt-tokens 9460, :pool-head "d89a4d6316770 R25.8 P4.7 h4.0 or1.4 L420 1/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+metadata+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.5,0.1,0.0] +q | Detecting changes ;; def28a8b441dc R25.3 P3.6 h3.0 or1.0 L665 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Query events ;; d1c1c23ebf524 R25.1 P3.6 h3.0 or0.9 L708 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Query app events enduser ;; df3874b9374bc R24.9 P2.5 h2.0 or0.5 L703 0/? ty:content+hypoth