odels business_model_0, 1, 2 differanse", :timestamp "2026-06-11T15:49:23.805649Z", :total-tokens 49039, :run-id "6ac4b140-d698-40bc-92fb-14646454c013", :golden-display-rank nil, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Basert på konteksten er forskjellen knyttet til **hvem som initierte forespørselen**, selv om sluttbrukeren i begge tilfeller må ta en aktiv godkjenningshandling i Altinn:\n\n- **Brukerstyrt opprettelse:** Sluttbrukeren starter prosessen og logger inn for å godkjenne/opprette tilgangen direkte [1].\n- **Leverandørstyrt opprettelse:** Systemleverandøren sender først en forespørsel, som deretter må godkjennes av deg i Altinn [1].\n\nUavhengig av hvilken metode som brukes, krever det at du har alle nødvendige roller og rettigheter for å kunne delegere den aktuelle tilgangen. Mangler én eller flere av disse rettighetene, stoppes prosessen uansett opprettingsmåte [1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? false, :question-id "ue-sys-03-brukerstyrt-vs-leverandorstyrt", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 474, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 0.0, :config-id "off", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-systemuser,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features nil, :response-chars 666, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 1, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? false, :golden-pool-rank nil, :golden-read? false, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "43e801d8644e", :enrichment-hits 0, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 0.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 8402, :pool-head "", :repeat 2, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "43e801d8644e", :expected-chunk-ids "c61c1f46fe63", :elapsed-ms 257160, :issued-queries "skille mellom bruker og organisasjon i Altinn selvbetjent versus overtatt rolle | opprettelse systembruker sluttbruker leverandør egen løsning oversiktstjeneste bruk-oss-melding", :timestamp "2026-06-11T15:51:24.624935Z", :total-tokens 8876, :run-id "b336d3d9-aa7a-4230-bf80-f006252389c4", :golden-display-rank nil, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 0.0} {:response "Basert på konteksten er hovedforskjellene knyttet til initiator, godkjenningsmekanisme og hvordan søknads- eller forespørselsløpet håndteres:\n\n• **Hvem som initierer:** Ved sluttbrukerstyrt eller brukerstyrt opprettelse initières prosessen av selve sluttbrukeren, som logger inn i Altinn og velger hvilket system de ønsker å opprette en systembrker for [2]. I leverandørstyrte opprettelse er derimot det sluttbruksersystem-leveranøren (SBSL) som initierer prosessen ved at leversdrren sender en forespørsel til Altinn fra sitt eget fagsytem om å opptreke systembrukeren med spesifiserte tillganger [1].\n\n• **Godkjennings- og opprettelseslup:** I sluttbrugerstyrt moedel blir brukern presentert for forhåndsdefinere tilganer direkte i Altinn. Når disse aksepters godkjes de umiddelbart, systembrukeren opptrekes uten at det generes en separa forespørsel [2]. Til gjengjeld må ved levrandsrst oppretkelse leverandørrens feuspørsel eksplisit godkjennses av slutbruken i Altinn før selve oprettelsen skjer [1].\n\n• **Myndighetskrav:** Begge metodene krever at sluttbrugerren har myndighet til å delegete samtlige (alle) de etterspurte ilgangne. For leverandrørstyrr oppretkelse er det spesielt presist i kekte, hvis brukern mangler mnyidhet for selv én av iltagnene kan ik forespørselen godkjennesi sin helhett [1]. Tilsvarende vilkår om full delegasjonsmyndighet gjelder også sluttbrugerstyrt oppretkelse hvor prosessen påfører at slutbrukeren har myndigheten til å deleget alle de berørte ilgangene for aksept skal være gyldig.\n\nKort sagt er kjerneforskjellen **hvem som starter kontakten** (leverandøren vs brukerne direkte i Altinn) og **hvorledes godkjenningssteppet håndteres** (en separata forespørsel må bekreftes av slutbrukeren vs dirette aksept uten mellomledd). Alle påstander er underbygd med kildene [1] og [2].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-sys-03-brukerstyrt-vs-leverandorstyrt", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 577, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "enriched-hq", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-systemuser,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d3ec63e860edb R16.7 P2.6 h2.0 or1.1 L763 2/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions b[0.1,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.1,0.0] +q | System user", :response-chars 1820, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 2, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "16049c347d69;c61c1f46fe63", :enrichment-hits 52, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 8642, :pool-head "d3ec63e860edb R16.8 P3.7 h3.0 or1.1 L683 3/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.1,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.1,0.0] +q | System user", :repeat 2, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "16049c347d69;c61c1f46fe63", :expected-chunk-ids "c61c1f46fe63", :elapsed-ms 292090, :issued-queries "SSB SRVB forskjell leverandør sluttbruker | opprette systembruk ssb selv eller leverandor | system business registration SSB end user created vs provider", :timestamp "2026-06-11T15:52:36.189486Z", :total-tokens 9219, :run-id "cf5726bf-f013-428e-8da2-16de81115279", :golden-display-rank 2, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Based on the provided documentation:\n\n**Fetching metadata for a single instance:**  \nYou can download the **instance metadata document** by sending a `GET` request to the App API at `{org}/{appname}/instances/{instanceOwnerPartyId}/{instanceGuid}` [1]. This endpoint is designed for active instances where you already know both the owner party ID and the instance GUID [1].\n\n**Listing all instances:**  \nThe App API **does not have an endpoint** that lists or queries multiple instances at once [1]. Instead, you should use a query endpoint from the **Storage API** (part of the Platform APIs) to list, search, or filter instances across applications [2].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-api-04-instances-get-no-list", :empty? false, :llm-calls 2, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 352, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "off", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-3-general,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d69ccc279de8b R19.1 P2.7 h2.0 or1.7 L1444 0/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Instances", :response-chars 655, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 3, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 3, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "9bce844fa9ba;3df2de7a83e9;12edc8b629a6", :enrichment-hits 0, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 5850, :pool-head "d79c43d59e568 R20.2 P1.4 h1.0 or1.0 L3353 0/? ty:content b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Commands ;; d1481641d88cb R20.0 P2.6 h2.0 or1.7 L3370 0/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Commands", :repeat 1, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "9bce844fa9ba;12edc8b629a6", :expected-chunk-ids "9bce844fa9ba", :elapsed-ms 169559, :issued-queries "fetch metadata single app instance | list all instances endpoint | instance metadata API Altinn", :timestamp "2026-06-11T15:55:25.751718Z", :total-tokens 6202, :run-id "b0e937f3-a4c4-429a-a844-dacd72f82836", :golden-display-rank 3, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "To fetch the metadata for a single app instance, you should use the **Get instance** endpoint from the App API:\n`GET {basePath}/{instanceOwnerPartyId}/{instanceGuid}` where `{basePath}` is defined as `{org}/{appname}/instances` [1]. This request requires that you already know both the active `owner party id` and the specific `instance guid` (or full URL), since these path parameters must be provided explicitly for each download of the instance metadata document [1].\n\nRegarding listing all instances, **the App API does not have an endpoint to list or query instances directly** [1]. Instead, you are directed to use a dedicated query/listing endpoint from the Storage API within Altinn Platform to retrieve and filter instance lists based on parameters such as owner party ID and state (`active`, `deleted`, or `archived`) [1][2].\n\n*Note on scope ambiguity:* While the general App API relies on the platform's Storage API for listing, the documentation also references message box-specific endpoints (e.g., `GET /sbl/instances/{instanceOwnerPartyId}?state={instanceState}&language={languageId}`) that handle searching and retrieving instances in a compressed MessageBoxInstance format [2]. These are distinct from the standard App API instance metadata retrieval and should only be used if you specifically need data formatted for the Altinn II message box [1][2].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "ue-api-04-instances-get-no-list", :empty? false, :llm-calls 4, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 653, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "off", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-3-general,hard", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d69ccc279de8b R20.7 P2.6 h2.0 or1.1 L1444 0/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Instances", :response-chars 1369, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 3, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 3, 